              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yoly"
            },
            "reviewBody": "2 cups of mayo? I thought that was excessive. I told myself that I would start out adding 1/2 cup at a time. Which is exactly what I did. 1/2 cup of mayo was perfect. I added red pepper flakes and garlic powder. Very good made this way. So glad I did not add the amount of mayo called for.",
            "datePublished": "2024-02-27T23:25:54.494Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dena Bean"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Unless you absolutely love mayo, skip this one. I just needed something in a hurry. That's what I get I guess. I made it edible by adding tons of dill weed, about 2 cloves of garlic and a lot of salt and pepper. I was able to take it to the party, but like I said folks, unless you LOVE MAYO, do yourself a favor and skip this one.",
